# ============================================================================
# MULBERRY GARDENS  (city park, 20x16 blocks, buffer 572/1300) johto_modern
# ============================================================================
# HOOK: Silkwater's botanical park, planted with the mulberry trees that
#   feed the city's silk moths. By day it is a garden with a glasshouse,
#   lily pond, fountain and bandstand; by night the fenced Moth Meadow
#   turns into a bug-catching ground (night-only Venonat/Venomoth, Dustox
#   in its season), and the Silkwater Bug Gym's trainees train here. It is
#   the south-of-Johto counterpart to the National Park, kept small.
#
# FEATURES
#   Glasshouse (3x4, window-wall dept-store art, NW): tropical-plant
#     interior, Grass-type puzzle, gardener gives a Miracle Seed/Leaf Stone
#   Moth Meadow (fenced tall grass, NE): only gap is on its west side next
#     to the avenue; 2 Bug Catcher trainers stand in the grass; item ball in
#     the far corner; a headbutt tree cluster in the middle
#   Lantern Fountain plaza (centre): brick square with a fenced pool, the
#     avenue splits around it
#   Lily Pond (SW): proper pond shore 54/76/55/58/59 with a railed south
#     bank 60/61/62; Surf-fishing spot, hidden item on the far bank
#   Bandstand (SE): open-fronted fenced stage on brick; a musician NPC
#     plays a different song per weekday (or per season)
#   Mulberry orchard (SW): 3 fruit trees (berries) among flower beds
#   Keeper's Lodge (small house, E): park keeper; rewards for caught bugs
#   Allee: headbutt-tree pairs (2f) line the avenue
#
# CONNECTIONS: S exit (cols 9-10) to Silkwater City's N brick avenue
#   (Silkwater cols 11-12, connection offset -2). N exit to a route.
# TILE GAPS: no bench, lamp or statue block; the pond has no plain south
#   shore so the railed 60-62 strip stands in for one.
# ============================================================================
tileset johto_modern
ref GoldenrodCity
key T=05 .=01 :=06 ,=02 *=04 "=03 Y=3f y=2f h=67 ~=35 n=43 u=61
key (=54 ^=76 )=55 [=58 ]=59 {=60 }=62
key r=40 f=41 t=42 <=44 >=46 l=48 e=49 j=4a s=45 g=47 w=66
key R=18 M=1f N=19 A=10 D=17 Z=11 H=27 I=23 J=28 1=14 2=13
grid:
TTTTTTTTT..TTTTTTTTT
TT,RMN,,y..rfffffftT
TT,HIJ,*,..<"""""">T
TT,HIJ,,y...""Y""">T
TT,ADZ,,,..<"""""">T
TT,,.,,Y,..leeeeeejT
T......::::::......T
T(^^),,:rfft:,,,"",T
T[~~],,:<~~>:,""",,T
T{uu},,:luuj:,,"",,T
T......::::::...12.T
T,*,*,,,y..y,rft,,,T
T,Y,,Y,,,..,,<:>,,,T
T*,*,*,,y..y,,,""",T
TTT,,,,,g..,,Y,,,TTT
TTTTTTTTT..TTTTTTTTT
end
exit N 18 0
exit S 18 31
exit Greenhouse 8 9
exit Lodge 33 21
exit Stage 28 25
obj warp 8 9 Glasshouse
obj warp 33 21 KeepersLodge
obj npc 10 12 Gardener down
obj trainer 26 6 BugCatcher_Ken down 3
obj trainer 32 10 BugCatcher_Rui left 4
obj item 35 4 meadow_corner
obj npc 28 24 Musician down
obj npc 26 16 Lady left
obj npc 12 17 Fisher left
obj hidden 10 15 pond_bank
obj fruit 3 24 Mulberry1
obj fruit 7 24 Mulberry2
obj fruit 13 24 Mulberry3
obj trainer 30 28 Picnicker_Aoi left 3
obj npc 36 22 Keeper
obj sign 17 29 ParkSign
